On Thu, Nov 09, 2006 at 09:52:02AM -0800, Robin Lee Powell wrote:
> In all of the following cases, the pause is required:

I forgot zo:

zo .bab. cmene mi

The pause is required, otherwise it's "zobab cmene mi", which
actually parses due to bare cmene being allowed at the beginning of
an utterance, but "mi se cmene zobab" does not.

